/E (It gives me great pleasure to invite you to participate in the Campus Recruitment Program 2026-27 of the Indian Institute of Technology Indore. At IIT Indore, we believe that education is not merely about imparting knowledge, it is about nurturing individuals who possess the curiosity to explore, the courage to innovate, and the character to lead with integrity. Our endeavor is to develop graduates who combine strong academic foundations with the ability to create meaningful impact in an increasingly interconnected and technology-driven world.)
