<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (The Department of Astronomy, Astrophysics and Space Engineering \(DAASE\), established in 2015, focuses on multi-wavelength astronomy, black holes, solar physics, cosmology, MHD simulations, and data-driven astronomy. Students gain exposure to electronics, data science, signal processing, AI/ML, embedded systems, remote sensing, and space instrumentation through projects involving CubeSats, satellite image processing, radio astronomy, and spacecraft systems, using tools such as FPGA/HDL platforms, Python, CASA, STK, and AI/ML frameworks.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
