<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (The Mehta School of Biosciences and Biomedical Engineering \(BSBE\) was initiated in 2012 focusing on research areas such as biosensors and bioelectronics, biophotonics, Tissue Engineering, Neurobiology, Cancer Biology, Drug Discovery, Bioprocessing, Environmental Biotechnology, Infectious Diseases, and Computational Biology. The department emphasizes research-driven learning through projects in ML-based drug discovery, biomechanical analysis, ultrasound diagnostics, bioprinted biomedical systems, molecular immunology and drug delivery systems. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
