<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (The Department of Humanities and Social Sciences, established in 2009, offers an MA in English focused on Literature and Linguistics, covering Literary and Cultural Studies, Applied Linguistics, Translation, Digital Humanities, and Medical Humanities. The research-oriented program develops skills in computational analysis, qualitative and statistical research, linguistic annotation, professional writing, and editing, preparing graduates for careers in AI and language technology, research, media, publishing, EdTech, advertising, HR, and public relations.)
/Pg 19 0 R
