482 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (The Center for Electric Vehicle and Intelligent Transport Systems \(CEVITS\) focuses on advancing electric mobility and intelligent transport technologies while preparing students for the evolving e-mobility sector and fostering impactful research. The projects currently in progress are in fields of HEV powertrains for drones, battery emulators, power converter design \(DAB, LLC\), SynRM motor development, thermal modelling of electric drives, and ISAC systems using IRS for vehicular networks. Students gain practical experience using industry-standard tools such as MATLAB Simulink, LTspice, MotorCAD, and Ansys. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
