855 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (Building on this commitment, CAMC organizes a range of career-oriented initiatives that facilitate meaningful interactions between students, industry leaders, HR professionals, recruiters, alumni, and working professionals. Students gain valuable insights to the changing hiring trends, recruitment processes, workplace expectations and emerging career opportunities through panel discussions, expert talks, experience sharing sessions and interactions. These platforms offer opportunities for knowledge exchange and industry-academia collaboration, enabling students to develop a deeper understanding of professional environments, align with industry expectations, and prepare effectively for internships, placements, and long-term career success.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
